# This workflow uses n8n's built-in Credential Manager for all auth (OAuth2),
# so there are no traditional env vars required inside the workflow itself.
# This file documents what you'll need to set up in n8n's Credentials section:

# Google Sheets OAuth2 credential (read/update invoice rows)
# Google Drive OAuth2 credential (copy template, export PDF, set sharing)
# Google Docs OAuth2 credential (fill placeholders via batchUpdate API)
# Gmail OAuth2 credential (send invoice email)
# Slack OAuth2 credential (send invoice DM)

# Values to replace directly inside workflow.json after import:
GOOGLE_SHEET_ID=your_google_sheet_id_here
GOOGLE_SHEET_GID=your_sheet_tab_gid_here
GOOGLE_DRIVE_TEMPLATE_FILE_ID=your_invoice_template_file_id_here
